PE 715: Sextuplet Norms

G(10) = 3053
G(10^5) ≡ 157612967 (mod 1e9+7)

Mathematical analysis:
  f(n) is multiplicative
  f(p) = p²(p-1)(p³ - χ₋₄(p))
  h(n) = f(n)/(n²·φ(n)) is multiplicative
  h(p) = p³ - χ₋₄(p) for odd p, h(2) = 8
  h(p^e) = h(p) · p^{3(e-1)}
  G(N) = Σ h(n) can be computed with min_25 sieve or
         using h = id³ * (μ·χ) convolution.
